      "id": "2122898611000209523",
      "text": "The #FlaPanthers trailed the #edmOilers 4-0 going into the third but Matthew Tkachuk’s 2-goal night was not enough for a comeback. Postgame reaction from Tkachuk and Paul Maurice up now ➡️ https://t.co/ztzMdHLg8b https://t.co/C8oB7nOZsh",
