    {
      "id": "2122890683421991342",
      "text": "Matthew Tkachuk praised Devon Levi postgame: “He’s a really good goalie.” As he did Connor McDavid: “Obviously McDavid’s controlling every single game he’s playing in right now, and he’s on a whole other level than anybody else in the league right now.”",
