      "text": "Panthers only gave up 6 scoring chances at 5-on-5 tonight. Forsling: “I like our gap. I think we didn't give them that much. Obviously they scored on a power play a couple of times there, which took the wind out of us a little bit. We did come back and pushed a little bit.”",
